WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.941
The creative brief is a set of questions, answered in order.

00:00:03.991 --> 00:00:05.344
What's the problem?

00:00:05.394 --> 00:00:06.759
Who's the audience, and what's the insight?

00:00:06.809 --> 00:00:08.009
What's different?

00:00:08.059 --> 00:00:11.099
What's the one thing to say?

00:00:11.149 --> 00:00:13.618
And why should anyone believe it?

00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:16.087
Take Kraft's Easy Mac.

00:00:16.137 --> 00:00:19.684
The brief targets mums, for teenage boys who get home starving.

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:23.299
The one thing to say: it fills them up, fast.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.073
The line was kill hunger fast.

00:00:26.123 --> 00:00:30.302
The client balked at the word kill, so it became the hunger blaster.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.176
Use it like this:

00:00:32.226 --> 00:00:33.533
one line per answer,

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:36.044
ending in one message and one reason to believe,

00:00:36.094 --> 00:00:38.422
both tied to the insight.
